                                "sense_id": "b04cc9b3-8dfb-31ca-b395-69081d57c57b",
                                "text": "The communal area is constantly cruisey, whether you′re slung low in a hammock or sipping your BYO stubbie in the cool, cushioned area with a frayed map in hand."
